      "content": "Subject: Re-claim your full FlowState potential with 100% feature parity.\n\n\"Return to the #1 CRM for **Automated Pipeline Management**, **Real-time Lead Scoring**, and **Contact Segmentation**, or rely on expert **Email Sequence Builder** capabilities to reclaim your lost momentum today. We have restored **Custom Dashboard Reporting** and **Task Automation Triggers** so you aren't left blind to opportunities while **Multi-channel Integration** and **Mobile App Access** keep you connected everywhere.\n\nYour work is now perfectly secure with **GDPR Compliance Suite**, **User Permissions Control**, and a **Smart Notification System** that ensures nothing slips through cracks.\n\nWe also restored **AI Sales Forecasting**, **Calendar Sync**, **Team Collaboration Tools**, and **Client Activity Tracking** within the **Advanced Search Filters** to help you find any record instantly.\nFinally, enjoy restored **Bulk Data Import** capabilities, full **API Access** for advanced developers, a curated **Template Library**, and a reliable **Offline Mode** so you never lose a client while navigating connectivity issues.\n\nClick 'Re-engage Now' to activate all 20 features immediately and see why our SDK has users like you back.\"",
